{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49873","headline":"金错刀 一 · 冯延巳","name":"金错刀 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双玉斗，百琼壶，佳人欢饮笑喧呼。\n麒麟欲画时难偶，鸥鹭何猜兴不孤。\n歌婉转，醉模糊，高烧银烛卧流苏。\n只销几觉懵腾睡，身外功名任有无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}